                                                "sense_id": "3f7494c5-2b86-30b6-aded-be6f7920ec72",
                                                "text": "“I can't keep doing this. Uh, I can't keep pretending to be Mr. Charisma to all these nimrods. It's awful.” “But the Energy Vampire Council said we have to win, or else.” [exhales] “No. No. No. Enough. It ends now.”"
