                                                "sense_id": "3f7494c5-2b86-30b6-aded-be6f7920ec72",
                                                "text": "“What is going on here?” “They had a strategy, Ty, which we should have had, which I did have.” “And she was properly wary of Barfus and me.” “What? Why would anyone be wary of you guys?” “Because we're spies, ya nimrod.” “Of course they are.”"
